IMPORTANT PATENT NOTICE

This software is an independent educational and research simulation of the
high-level architecture described in United States Patent US10,673,617 B1
("Methods, system and point-to-point encryption device microchip for AES-sea
512-bit key using identity access management utilizing blockchain ecosystem
to improve cybersecurity").

It is NOT an official product of the patent owners, NOT a bit-exact
implementation of any proprietary algorithm described in the patent, and
does NOT grant any license under the patent. Commercial use of the patented
inventions requires appropriate rights from the patent holders.

The simulation uses standard, publicly documented cryptographic primitives
(AES-256, SHA-256) to illustrate the system flow for demonstration,
education, and research purposes only.
